OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FThe "apocalyptic scenes" caused by
OL,7,Fhuge blazes in the West Midlands have
OL,8,Fled to thousands of 999 calls on the
OL,9,FUK's hottest day of the year, a fire
OL,10,Fchief has said.
OL,12,FChief fire officer Simon Tuhill, of
OL,13,FWest Midlands Fire Service, said one
OL,14,Fhuge blaze in Stourbridge, which
OL,15,Fforced some people to flee after it
OL,16,Fstarted tearing through homes, left
OL,17,F"extensive" devastation ` adding that
OL,18,Fit was "one of the most significant"
OL,19,Fincidents the region's fire service
OL,20,Fhas ever dealt with.
OL,26,@nD@EOUnD@XO]yD@AOUyD@KO]zD@HOUzD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FMr Tuhill said he had been in touch
OL,7,Fwith Prime Minister Andy Burnham, who
OL,8,Freleased a statement shortly
OL,9,Fafterwards to pay tribute to the
OL,10,Ffirefighters on the ground battling
OL,11,Fthe wildfires.
OL,13,FThe Prime Minister said: "Awful to see
OL,14,Fhomes and communities hit by fires
OL,15,Facross the country tonight as the
OL,16,Fheatwave continues.
OL,26,@uD@ZOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,F"My thoughts are with everyone
OL,7,Faffected, particularly those who have
OL,8,Fbeen injured or forced from their
OL,9,Fhomes, and with the firefighters who
OL,10,Fhave been taken to hospital.
OL,12,F"I'm in touch with local leaders
OL,13,F(including West Midlands Mayor Richard
OL,14,FParker) and will be speaking to
OL,15,Femergency services on the ground as
OL,16,Fthey continue their response.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,F"Our firefighters are working in
OL,7,Fincredibly difficult conditions and
OL,8,Fputting themselves at risk to keep
OL,9,Fothers safe. A huge thank you to them
OL,10,Fand everyone supporting the effort
OL,11,Ftonight."
OL,13,FNathan Hudson, from West Midlands
OL,14,FAmbulance Service, said six people
OL,15,Fwere treated by crews at the scene in
OL,16,Fthe town, with two taken to hospital
OL,17,Fafter suffering from smoke inhalation.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has pledged to support
OL,7,Ffire and rescue services in the region
OL,8,Fwith any additional resources they
OL,9,Fneed, the county's mayor Richard
OL,10,FParker told Sky News.
OL,12,FAngela Rayner, Secretary of State for
OL,13,Fhousing, communities and local
OL,14,FGovernment said: "We are working
OL,15,Fclosely with the local Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService and partners on the ground in
OL,17,FStourbridge and are being regularly
OL,18,Fupdated.
OL,26,@vD@ROU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
