OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,F"I would like to thank the brave
OL,7,Femergency services, and my thoughts
OL,8,Fare with people who have been forced
OL,9,Fto leave their homes."
OL,11,FThe Met Office said 38.1C was recorded
OL,12,Fat Kew Gardens in London on Thursday `
OL,13,Fthe second time this year the country
OL,14,Fhas seen temperatures reach 38C.
OL,16,FTemperatures are set to cool slightly
OL,17,Fon Friday, with highs of 34C expected
OL,18,Fin the south east. But little rain is
OL,19,Fforecast for the Midlands and many
OL,20,Fparts of the country over the weekend.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
