OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FThe West Midlands was subject to an
OL,7,Famber warning for extreme heat for
OL,8,Fmuch of Thursday before multiple fires
OL,9,Fwere reported, which was set to expire
OL,10,Fjust before midnight.
OL,12,FSpeaking at the scene of the
OL,13,FStourbridge blaze, Mr Tuhill said more
OL,14,Fthan 100 firefighters were sent to the
OL,15,Fscene, saying the fire is believed to
OL,16,Fhave started in the grassland before
OL,17,Fspreading to homes nearby.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FAn investigation into how the fire in
OL,7,FStourbridge, West Midlands, started
OL,8,Fwill now begin, the chief fire officer
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FBefore the press conference, Mr Parker
OL,12,Fdescribed the "multiple fires across
OL,13,Four region" as an "extremely worrying
OL,14,Fand fast-moving situation".
OL,16,FIn neighbouring Worcestershire,
OL,17,FHereford & Worcester Fire and Rescue
OL,18,FService said a number of homes had
OL,19,Fbeen damaged and 30 properties were
OL,20,Fevacuated in Pershore following a
OL,21,Flarge fire on Lancelott Court.
OL,26,@tD@OOUuD@KO]uD@SOUvD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FThe fire service said one person was
OL,7,Ftreated for smoke inhalation following
OL,8,Fthe incident at about 4.30pm, and
OL,9,Fabout 200 homes in the area were left
OL,10,Fwithout power.
OL,12,FIn Stoke-on-Trent in Staffordshire,
OL,13,Fanother blaze hit "a small number of
OL,14,Fproperties and gardens" in the
OL,15,FGoldenhill area of the city.
OL,17,FSevern Trent Water warned of
OL,18,Fdisruption to water supply across the
OL,19,FWest Midlands as a result of the
OL,20,Fwildfires.
OL,26,@uD@SOUvD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
