OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FThe company said customers in
OL,7,FKidsgrove, near Stoke-on-Trent, may
OL,8,Fexperience lower pressure and
OL,9,Fdiscoloured water because firefighters
OL,10,Fneeded to use hydrants.
OL,12,FIn Warwickshire, the county's fire and
OL,13,Frescue service said it was responding
OL,14,Fto a "large fire" in Salford Priors,
OL,15,FStratford-upon-Avon, which has been
OL,16,Fdeclared a major incident.
OL,18,FPolice, fire crews and ambulances are
OL,19,Fat the scene of the wildfire.
OL,26,@vD@FOUvD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
