OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FWollaston & Stourbridge Town
OL,7,Fcouncillor Andrew Southall said care
OL,8,Fhome residents were evacuated
OL,9,Falongside others as a result of the
OL,10,Ffire near Stourbridge golf course.
OL,12,FResident Phillip Jones, who lives
OL,13,Fclose to where the fire in Stourbridge
OL,14,Ftook hold, told Sky News: "It was
OL,15,Fquite hard to breathe, actually, when
OL,16,Fwe left the car, getting to the home."
OL,18,FHe added: "We have the golf course and
OL,19,Fthen the cricket club between us and
OL,20,Fthe fire.
OL,26,@vD@[OUxD@fO]zD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,F"So, at the moment, we have grab bags
OL,7,Fby the door, ready to leave if we have
OL,8,Fto leave, but it hasn't come to that
OL,9,Fyet, thankfully for us."
OL,11,FFootage on social media showed
OL,12,Fmultiple buildings on fire and huge
OL,13,Fplumes of smoke coming from a nearby
OL,14,Ffield.
OL,16,FThe fire service said flames were
OL,17,Fspreading "across roads in places",
OL,18,Fwith people urged to stay indoors.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@XO]yD@KOUyD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FDrone footage published by the force
OL,7,Fshowed a heat map of flames
OL,8,Fthreatening to engulf homes in the
OL,9,Farea as smoke billowed across the town.
OL,11,FStourbridge town hall has been set up
OL,12,Fas a rescue centre for people who have
OL,13,Fhad to flee their homes.
OL,15,FCouncillor Andrew Tromans, who
OL,16,Frepresents Wollaston and Stourbridge
OL,17,FTown on Dudley Borough Council,
OL,18,Fdescribed the scene of the fire in
OL,19,FStourbridge as "apocalyptic".
OL,26,@{D@POU{D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786666699
OL,3,CThousands of 999 calls across West
OL,4,CMidlands after 'apocalyptic' fires
OL,6,FIn a statement on Facebook, he said:
OL,7,F"The apocalyptic scenes in Norton and
OL,8,Facross Stourbridge are sadly just a
OL,9,Ftaste of what is to come if we don't
OL,10,Fact."
OL,12,FHe added: "It is my view, and it has
OL,13,Fbeen for a while, that Dudley
OL,14,Fcouncillors must have an emergency
OL,15,Fmeeting about we protect our borough
OL,16,Ffrom the impacts of climate change."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@EO]tD@KOUxD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/15
